# Create Believers — connection to the private tracker (Supabase).
# Both values are safe to publish: the project address and its PUBLISHABLE key.
# Never put the secret / service_role key here or anywhere in this repository.
# For the live site these are set as GitHub repository variables (see docs/CREATE_BELIEVERS.md).
VITE_CB_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_CB_SUPABASE_KEY=
# Optional: set to 1 to build a preview that shows illustrative examples when no connection is configured.
# VITE_CB_PREVIEW=1
